<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Cadenalco nine month profits fall.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Cadenalco nine month profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's biggest supermarket chain Cadenalco posted the following accumulated results for the first three quarters January to September:</p>
<p>Net profits 5.336 billion pesos, compared to 7.843 billion pesos over the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>Operating profits after monetary correction 7.057 billion pesos, against 5.002 billion pesos.</p>
<p>Operating income 546.8 billion pesos compared to 422.35 billion pesos.</p>
<p>-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom 571 610 7944</p>
</text>
